    "id": "795e45f67ba145b5547f",
    "source": "prototype",
    "context": "*",
    "original": "The game is controlled by keyboard commands which are upper and lower case sensitive. Within menus you can also use mouse to point and click desired options. These are the keys you need to survive in the far north.",
    "translation": "游戏主要通过键盘操作，命令区分大小写。在菜单中，也可以用鼠标点击选项。以下按键将帮助你在遥远的北方生存。",
    "status": "reviewed"
  },
  {
    "id": "b72a7baa912a2c6cfe12",
    "source": "prototype",
    "context": "*",
